# Expected failures of tests/check-nm.sh (architecture spine AD-1).
# One line per (file, pattern): <file> <symbol|glob> <item>, naming the one
# spec item the fix waits for. The check compiles each file at -O2 and
# again at -O0; a line spans both passes and reports XFAIL with the symbols
# it matched, each with its pass, or XPASS, which fails the run, once it
# matches none in either pass: the series that removes a symbol deletes its
# line in the same commit. A writable symbol that no line matches fails the
# run in the pass that lists it. See tests/README.md.
